  "limitations": [
    "Only snapshots committed to PostgreSQL survive a process crash. In-flight tool evidence remains in memory until terminal save.",
    "An interrupted Agent is marked cancelled rather than resumed. Redis, independent workers, per-tool checkpoints and automatic retries are later work.",
    "Frontend draft edits are not persisted. Old lost in-memory jobs cannot be recovered retroactively.",
    "One local backend owns the database session; no connection pool, automatic reconnection, authentication, backup, retention policy or schema migration system was added.",
    "This PostgreSQL cluster is local development infrastructure, not a production deployment."
  ],
  "recommended_next_step": "Separate analysis execution from the API with an independent background worker; then add durable checkpoints and bounded retries."
